  "Total 60 as published (headers 6/7/20/3/7/8/9).",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(6)': the Objective, Executor: Holotheatre, Visage Of The Emperor, Executor: Meditation Chamber, Twi'lek Advisor and Bad Feeling Have I; they count toward the 60. The strategy says 'Twi'lek for Bad Feeling Have I or another effect of your choice', so Twi'lek Advisor is the starting Interrupt and no single starting Effect is set. A second Twi'lek Advisor is listed under Interrupts.",
